{"id":"n73257-1-32","stage":1,"title":"양복 · 西装","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73257-1-32-1","ko":"어때, 이 정장이 내게 좀 어울려?","zh":"怎么样，这套西装我穿合适吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어때,","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"정장이","meaning":"正装","explanation":"정장：正装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정장","audio":"/audio/e22229bb260aee036fe0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31763","senseId":"1","lemma":"정장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정장이","audio":"/audio/e06af3141d1bf549892b.mp3"}},{"text":"내게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내게","audio":"/audio/ced087689b947fbe376c.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어울려?","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어울려","audio":"/audio/12c688c61bc1ff3e7d19.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e22229bb260aee03","term":"정장","zh":"正装","audio":"/audio/e22229bb260aee036fe0.mp3","entryId":"31763","definition":"正式场合主要穿的符合礼仪的衣服。","pronunciation":["정ː장"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ee7c2e65832650761bf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73257-1-32-2","ko":"그럼! 이렇게 양복을 빼입으니까 누구인지 몰라보겠는걸.","zh":"那当然！你穿成这样，简直让人认不出是谁了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼!","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"양복을","meaning":"西装","explanation":"양복：西装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양복을","audio":"/audio/581e2a4f1001de358e15.mp3"}},{"text":"빼입으니까","meaning":"穿得整齐漂亮","explanation":"빼입다：穿得整齐漂亮；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"빼입다","audio":"/audio/adb2bdc68591ee200351.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:빼입다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"빼입다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼입으니까","audio":"/audio/d355c0bf3415663e3162.mp3"}},{"text":"누구인지","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구인지","audio":"/audio/0302d73aa0aba8baf899.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라보겠는걸.","meaning":"认不出","explanation":"몰라보다：认不出；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"몰라보다","audio":"/audio/c63743351d86a4945436.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56011","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라보겠는걸","audio":"/audio/c3ce930b4610705bb476.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"adb2bdc68591ee20","term":"빼입다","zh":"穿得整齐漂亮","audio":"/audio/adb2bdc68591ee200351.mp3","definition":"特意把衣服穿得讲究、漂亮。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁",